{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16802","headline":"赋四相诗 中书令锺绍京 · 皇甫澈","name":"赋四相诗 中书令锺绍京","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"景龙仙驾远，中禁奸衅结。\n谋猷叶圣朝，披鳞奋英节。\n青宫阊阖啓，涤秽氛沴灭。\n紫气重昭回，皇天新日月。\n从容庙堂上，肃穆人神悦。\n唐元佐命功，辉焕何烈烈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫澈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16802.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16802","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}